==Battleground==
*4 [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Gobble]] spawns as the boss after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 96.67 seconds<sup>2,900f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 136.67 seconds<sup>4,100f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage poses very little threat due to the lack of pushing force. Most units that outrange Owlbrow or have LD will win the stage.

